    <p class="content-note">Holafly's number is per day of unlimited use; AloSIM's is per gigabyte on its fixed plans (AloSIM's own unlimited plans aren't broken out by destination pricing here). A short, light-data trip usually costs less on AloSIM's fixed plans; a longer or data-heavy trip usually favors Holafly's flat rate or AloSIM's unlimited option.</p>
